                    <label>Enable unsafe inline for scripts</label>
                    <comment><![CDATA[This setting permits the execution of unsafe inline scripts,
                        which can be introduced by your developers / third party
                        extensions / attackers. Make sure you assess these unsafe
                        inline scripts before setting this to YES. <br />
                        <strong class="colorRed" style="font-size:15px;">Enabling unsafe inline scripts is a temporary
                        measure and should only be done under the guidance of your developer. You must ask
                        your developers or third party extension
                        providers to whitelist their inline scripts.
                        This setting must NOT be left on 'YES' permanently,
                        as it significantly increases the risk of security vulnerabilities,
                        making your site an easy target for attackers.
                        Always prioritise the security of your site and user data.</strong>]]></comment>
